title: "[Beslisboom] AddMediatRPattern.Rewrite" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q1: "x.AddMediatR(lambda met\néén parameter)?" {shape: diamond}
q2: "Body: expressie of blok met\nalleen expressie-statements (ook leeg)?" {shape: diamond}
q3: "Per instelling:\nRegisterServicesFrom*?" {shape: diamond}
q4: "(Open)Behavior/StreamBehavior/Pre-/PostProcessor\nmet alleen typeof / generics?" {shape: diamond}
q5: "Lifetime = ServiceLifetime.X,\nRegisterGenericHandlers of\ningebouwde NotificationPublisher?" {shape: diamond}
q6: "Expression body\nmet meer dan een toewijzing?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: not called as AddMediatR(cfg => ...)\n(no-lambda)"
m2: "Manual: not a list of cfg calls\n(geen proof)"
m3: "Manual: cfg.X(...) has no direct equivalent\n(unknown-call, behavior-lifetime)"
m4: "Manual: 'instelling' has no direct equivalent\n(geen proof; eigen publisher)"
m5: "Manual: several settings in expression lambda\n(geen proof)"
d: "vervalt (source generator)"
b: "PipelineBehaviors / StreamPipelineBehaviors += typeof(...)\n(open pre-processor: X<> -> X<,>)"
l: "ServiceLifetime (standaard Transient),\nvervalt, of NotificationPublisherType"
s: "Scanned: gesloten exception handlers en\nprocessors vooraan in PipelineBehaviors"
f: "AddMediator(cfg => ...)\n(behaviors, expression, empty, processors, publisher,\nedge-assemblies, edge-service-type-behavior, edge-publisher-qualified, generic-handlers)"
q1 -> m1: nee
q1 -> q2: ja
q2 -> m2: nee
q2 -> q3: ja
q3 -> d: ja
q3 -> q4: nee
q4 -> b: ja
q4 -> q5: "geen aanroep"
q4 -> m3: "andere aanroep"
